roles={'proof':'''INDEPENDENT ADVERSARIAL FULL CORRECTNESS REVIEW. Reconstruct every deduction and check all frozen quantifiers. PASS only if the entire unchanged statement follows from the unchanged proof with no necessary repair or essential unverified dependency. If a necessary mathematical correction/gap is established,give NEEDS_REPAIR and exact equations/lines and scoped counterexamples. If essential verification cannot finish,give INCOMPLETE with precise missing work. Do not silently repair author files,substitute a nearby theorem,or assign contribution/acceptance/count. Small calculations supplement,never replace,proof. Distinguish actual theorem dependencies from the broader supplied source stipulation.\n\n''','contribution':'''INDEPENDENT FULL-SCOPE SUBSTANTIAL-CONTRIBUTION REVIEW,CONDITIONAL on correctness of the ENTIRE unchanged theorem. Do not inspect the correctness review or assign correctness PASS. Compare the strongest integrated actual source/primary/classical operations,at full normalization and full countable scope. If they pay all conclusions,provide the complete compatible derivation and give TECHNICAL,even if the bound is sharp or impressive. If a genuine additional nonroutine operation is supplied beyond those reductions,justify SUBSTANTIAL precisely. If an essential comparison is uncompleted,give INCOMPLETE;unread literature or failure of a naive method is not evidence of substantial contribution. Check the actual atom-jump potential as well as classical substitutes. A known sharpness family is not a second contribution. Preserve provenance of model-generated antecedent supplements. No acceptance/count or world-priority assertion.\n\n'''}
for role,instruction in roles.items():
 root=B/f'arithmetic-r162bo-{role}-r1';bp=B/f'expanded-target-2026-10-17/arithmetic-r162bo-{role}-r1-brief.txt'
